{% extends "layout.jinja2" %}

{% block content %}
  <main class="vl-grid">
    <div class="vl-col--1-1">
      <h1 class="vl-title vl-title--h1">Typografie en iconen</h1>

      <section aria-labelledby="headings-title">
        <h2 id="headings-title" class="vl-title vl-title--h2">Koppen</h2>
        <h1 class="vl-title vl-title--h1">Heading 1</h1>
        <h2 class="vl-title vl-title--h2">Heading 2</h2>
        <h3 class="vl-title vl-title--h3">Heading 3</h3>
        <h4 class="vl-title vl-title--h4">Heading 4</h4>
        <h5 class="vl-title vl-title--h5">Heading 5</h5>
        <h6 class="vl-title vl-title--h6">Heading 6</h6>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <section aria-labelledby="icons-title">
        <h2 id="icons-title" class="vl-title vl-title--h2">Iconen</h2>
        <ul class="vl-icon-list">
          <li class="vl-icon-list__item"><span class="vl-vi vl-vi-check-thin" aria-hidden="true"></span> Check</li>
          <li class="vl-icon-list__item"><span class="vl-vi vl-vi-data-download" aria-hidden="true"></span> Download</li>
          <li class="vl-icon-list__item"><span class="vl-vi vl-vi-mail" aria-hidden="true"></span> E-mail</li>
          <li class="vl-icon-list__item"><span class="vl-vi vl-vi-printer" aria-hidden="true"></span> Afdrukken</li>
          <li class="vl-icon-list__item"><span class="vl-vi vl-vi-calendar" aria-hidden="true"></span> Kalender</li>
          <li class="vl-icon-list__item"><span class="vl-vi vl-vi-arrow-left" aria-hidden="true"></span> Vorige</li>
          <li class="vl-icon-list__item"><span class="vl-vi vl-vi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span> Volgende</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          <a class="vl-link" href="https://www.vlaanderen.be/vlaanderen-design-system/foundations/iconen"
             target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bekijk de volledige iconenset</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <hr>

      <article aria-labelledby="article-title">
        <h2 id="article-title" class="vl-title vl-title--h2">Artikeltekst</h2>
        <h3 class="vl-title vl-title--h3">Een voorbeeldartikel</h3>
        <p>
          Maecenas ac tortor nec <strong>ligula facilisis commodo</strong>. Etiam cursus augue ac interdum
          lobortis. Class aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per
          <a class="vl-link" href="#">inceptos himenaeos</a>. Suspendisse libero magna, volutpat vel massa sed,
          mollis hendrerit nisi. Quisque non augue a nisi auctor molestie ac sed turpis.
        </p>
        <h4 class="vl-title vl-title--h4">Een tussenkop</h4>
        <p>
          Phasellus pulvinar, orci nec condimentum fringilla, mi arcu iaculis metus. Etiam cursus augue ac
          interdum lobortis. Suspendisse libero magna, volutpat vel massa sed, mollis hendrerit nisi.
        </p>
      </article>

      <hr>

      <section aria-labelledby="paragraphs-title">
        <h2 id="paragraphs-title" class="vl-title vl-title--h2">Alinea’s</h2>
        <p>
          Maecenas ac tortor nec ligula facilisis commodo. Etiam cursus augue ac interdum lobortis.
          Class aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per inceptos himenaeos.
          Suspendisse libero magna, volutpat vel massa sed, mollis hendrerit nisi.
        </p>
        <p>
          Cras leo lacus, ultrices in orci id, porttitor finibus metus. Pellentesque iaculis libero a erat
          tempor, id interdum lectus sodales. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et
          malesuada fames ac turpis egestas.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
{% endblock %}
